    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami akoranya abakuru bose b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adugana ku Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " n’abantu bose b’i Buyuda, ababa i Yerusalemu, abaherezi hamwe n’abavugishwa, n’abantu bose uhereye ku muto ugashitsa ku mukuru. Abasomera amajambo yo muri ca Gitabu c’Isezerano cari catowe mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahejeje ahagarara i ruhande y’inkingi, asubizaho isezerano imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ko agiye kwubaha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", no gukurikiza amabwirizwa, amategeko hamwe n’ivyagezwe vyiwe, akabikora n’umutima wiwe wose n’umushaha wiwe wose, mu gushitsa ivyanditswe muri ico gitabu. Maze abantu bose bemera gusubira muri iryo sezerano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami aca ategeka umuherezi mukuru n’abakorana na we bose, n’abarinzi b’urwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bose gukura ikintu cose cari cakorewe Bayali na Ashera hamwe n’ivy’ibinyenyeri vyo kw’ijuru. Babituririra inyuma y’igisagara ca Yerusalemu mu mwonga wa Kidironi, iminyota yavyo bayitwara i Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yirukana abaherezi b’abanyamahanga bari bashizweho n’abami b’i Buyuda kugira ngo baze baraturirira ibimota neza ku misozi miremire yo mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu yikikuje Yerusalemu. Bashikanira ibimota neza Bayali, izuba, ukwezi, inyenyeri hamwe n’ibindi vyose vyo kw’ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asohora mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " inkingi ya Ashera bayitwara mu mwonga wa Kidironi inyuma y’igisagara ca Yerusalemu, bayituririrayo. Baca bafata umunyota wayo, baja kuwuta mw’itongo ry’abapfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya yongera asambura inzu z’abamaraya b’abagabo n’abagore zari mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ari na ho abagore bajishira ibitambara bapfukisha inkingi ya Ashera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yongera ahamagaza abaherezi bose, kuva i Geba gushika i Berisheba, bakora igikorwa c’ubuherezi mu Buyuda bwose, ahumanya ibibanza vyose vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi batangiramwo ibimazi. I Yerusalemu, amenagura ibicaniro vyose vyari hafi y’Irembo rya Yosuwa umukuru w’igisagara, vyari i bubamfu bw’urwinjiriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho abaherezi bo mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi batari bemerewe kugira ico bokora ku gicaniro c’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " i Yerusalemu, barasangira n’abandi baherezi bagenzi babo imikate itarimwo umwambiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami yongera akuraho igicaniro ca Tofeti mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, ntihagira abasubira kuhashikanira abana babo nk’ibimazi vyo guturira babishikanira Moleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuraho amafarasi yari ku rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abami b’Abayuda bari barashikanye mu gusenga izuba. Ayo mafarasi yari mu kigo imbere, hafi y’inzu ya Natani-Meleki inkone, akaba n’umutware. Yosiya aca aturira imikogote yayo yari yarashikaniwe izuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amenagura ibicaniro vyose abami b’i Buyuda bari bubatse hejuru ku bisenge vy’inzu ya Ahazi, asenyura n’ibicaniro vyose Manase yari yarubakishije mu mabaraza y’Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", arabimenagura bicika ubunywenywe, hanyuma baravyegeranya baja kubita mu mwonga wa Kidironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami akuraho n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi vyari mu buseruko bwa Yerusalemu hepfo y’ivyo umwami Salomo yari yarubakiye ikigirwamanakazi Ashitaroti y’Abanyesidoni, Kemoshi imana y’Abanyamowabu, na Moleki imana y’Abamoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowashi amenagura amabuye y’ibiterekerwa, atemagura inkingi za Ashera, aho vyari aharenzako amagufa y’abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ibicaniro vy’i Beteli hamwe n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi vyubatswe na Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, yari yakwegeye Abisirayeli mu vyaha, vyose arabimenagura. Aturira ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi, bicika iminyota, aturira n’inkingi ya Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya aravye hirya no hino abona imva nyinshi ku musozi. Aca ategeka ko bazikuramwo amagufa yose, hanyuma ayaturirira kuri ico gicaniro c’i Beteli kugira ngo agihumanye. Ivyo vyabaye nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabivugishije umuntu wayo igihe Yerobowamu yari ahagaze i ruhande y’igicaniro mu misi mikuru. Maze Yosiya ahindukiye akaraba ku ruhande, ni ho yabona imva y’umuntu w’Imana yabivugishijwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca arabaza ati: “Kiriya cibutso mbona hariya ni ic’iki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bo muri ico gisagara baramwishura bati: “Ni imva y’umuntu w’Imana w’i Buyuda yavugishijwe ibi vyose uhejeje gukorera iki gicaniro c’i Beteli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we arababwira ati: “Nimuyireke, ntihagire uwukomakoma amagufa yiwe.” Nuko amagufa yiwe barayarengana, co kimwe n’ay’abandi bavugishwa bari bavuye i Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya asambura n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi mu bisagara vya Samariya vyari vyubatswe n’abami ba Isirayeli bigatera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gushangashirwa, yongera arabihumanya nk’uko yabigenjeje i Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya yongera yica abaherezi bose bo ku bicaniro vyo muri ivyo bibanza vyo gusengeramwo yongera ahumanya ivyo bicaniro mu kubituririrako amagufa y’abantu, maze asubira i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami aca atanga itegeko ku bantu bose ati: “Muzokwame muhimbaza Pasika y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nk’uko vyanditswe muri iki gitabu c’Isezerano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihari bwigere hahimbazwa umusi mukuru wa Pasika nk’uwo, uhereye mu gihe abacamanza batwara igihugu ca Isirayeli ugashitsa ku bami b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo Pasika y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yahimbajwe mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yosiya ari ku ngoma i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gukurikiza ivyo muri ico Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe cari catowe mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " na Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru, Yosiya yirukana abavugana n’imizimu, imana z’imiryango, hamwe n’ibindi bigirwamana vyose vyasengwa, haba i Yerusalemu canke i Buyuda hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta mwami yigeze abaho ameze nka Yosiya, haba mu batwaye imbere yiwe canke abatwaye inyuma yiwe; yagarutse k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " n’umutima wiwe wose n’umushaha wiwe wose, n’inkomezi ziwe zose, nk’uko Ivyagezwe vya Mose vyabivuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ubushangashirwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yaratewe n’Ubuyuda ntibwigeze buhwama kubera ivyo Manase yari yarakoze vyose vyatumye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aterwa n’ishavu ryinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aravuga ati: “Nzirukana Abayuda mu maso yanje nk’uko nirukanye Abisirayeli, kandi nzokwihakana Yerusalemu, igisagara natoranije, hamwe n’Ingoro navugiyeko nti: ‘Izina ryanje rizoba muri yo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
